  "description": "*“I shouldn’t have confessed.”* \n\nEun-Ju, an ordinary office worker, is caught by her new subordinate, Lee-Jun, trying to confess to her long-time crush on the team leader. Eun-Ju, who wants to clear up the misunderstanding, also reveals that she can’t confess…!\n\n *“Manager, can I tell you a secret of mine to be fair?”*\n\nThe story of us who fail to confess.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
